{"id":"1b0c7c641c8c6719","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-universal-tm.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine","display":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-universal-tm","aliases":["28-df-universal-tm","Universal Turing Machine"],"display":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-godel-numbering]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"20","source_pdf_pages":"46"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-universal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-universal-tm</span><span>Universal Turing Machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-tm — Universal Turing Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"20"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"46"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}\">\\(M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}\\)</span> 的输出/发散由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a> 定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner M\\urcorner\\)</span> 与二串配对来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b54d75aae768415e\" href=\"?note=b54d75aae768415e\" title=\"28-df-godel-numbering\">28-df-godel-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Universal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x\\rangle)=M(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Universal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x\\rangle)=M(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>统一采用偏计算的总化值域：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\uparrow\">\\(\\uparrow\\)</span> 仅等于自身，故等式同时保持发散与有限输出。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 1.9，印刷 p.20 / PDF p.46；此项只定义通用性。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}$ 的输出/发散由 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 定义。$\\ulcorner M\\urcorner$ 与二串配对来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b54d75aae768415e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}$ 的输出/发散由 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 定义。$\\ulcorner M\\urcorner$ 与二串配对来自 [[28-df-godel-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U,M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"M(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\cup\\{\\uparrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner M\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Universal}(U)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;U(\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner,x\\rangle)=M(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\uparrow","display":false}],"bytes":1170,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"通用与标准化机器：[[28-df-universal-tm]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]、[[28-thm-oblivious-simulation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","b54d75aae768415e","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}